{"seq":42,"at":"2026-10-23","kind":"edited","target":{"type":"article","id":"a0728"},"reason":"Expanded the Good Friday sentence (the three o'clock liturgy, the silent bells said to fly to Rome) and added a table row, giving the new Good Friday fact.","by":"fact-count-rework","changes":[{"field":"bodyEn","diff":[["=",516],["-","On"],["+","The"],["=",1],["+","next day is "],["=",2],["-","Friday"],["+","Friday,"],["=",3],["-","crucifixion"],["+","day"],["=",1],["+","of the crucifixion. Its liturgy "],["=",2],["-","recalled"],["+","held"],["=",1],["+","ideally at three "],["=",2],["-","silence,"],["+","the"],["=",1],["-","without"],["+","afternoon,"],["=",1],["+","the hour at which tradition says Jesus died on the cross; the altars are bare, and from the Thursday evening until the Easter Vigil no church bell is rung – in Belgium and parts of France children are told that the "],["=",2],["-","or"],["+","have"],["=",1],["-","organ,"],["+","flown"],["=",1],["+","to Rome "],["=",2],["+","will bring back the Easter eggs. "],["=",644],["+","Good Friday | Crucifixion | Friday before "],["=",3],["+","\n|"],["=",1],["+","Easter | "],["=",85]]},{"field":"bodyDe","diff":[["=",496],["-","Am"],["+","Der"],["=",1],["-","Karfreitag"],["+","nächste"],["=",1],["+","Tag ist der Karfreitag, der Tag der Kreuzigung. Seine Liturgie "],["=",2],["+","möglichst um drei Uhr nachmittags gefeiert, "],["=",2],["-","Kreuzigung"],["+","Stunde,"],["=",3],["-","Stille"],["+","der"],["=",1],["-","gedacht,"],["+","Jesus"],["=",1],["-","ohne"],["+","nach"],["=",1],["-","Glocken"],["+","der"],["=",1],["+","Überlieferung am Kreuz starb; die Altäre sind leer, "],["=",2],["-","Orgel,"],["+","vom"],["=",1],["+","Donnerstagabend bis zur Osternacht läutet keine Kirchenglocke – in Belgien "],["=",2],["-","der"],["+","Teilen"],["=",1],["+","Frankreichs erzählt man Kindern, die Glocken seien nach Rom geflogen und brächten auf dem Rückweg die Ostereier mit. Der "],["=",574],["+","Karfreitag | Kreuzigung | Freitag vor "],["=",3],["+","\n|"],["=",1],["+","Ostern | "],["=",79]]},{"field":"bodyRu","diff":[["=",442],["-","В"],["+","Следующий"],["=",1],["-","Страстную"],["+","день"],["=",1],["-","пятницу"],["+","—"],["=",1],["-","распятие"],["+","Страстная"],["=",1],["-","вспоминают"],["+","пятница,"],["=",1],["+","день распятия. Её богослужение по возможности совершают "],["=",2],["-","тишине,"],["+","три"],["=",1],["-","без"],["+","часа"],["=",1],["-","колоколов"],["+","дня"],["=",1],["+","— в час, когда, по преданию, Иисус умер на кресте; алтари стоят обнажёнными, "],["=",2],["-","органа,"],["+","с"],["=",1],["-","а"],["+","вечера"],["=",1],["+","четверга до Пасхальной вигилии не звонит ни один церковный колокол — в Бельгии и некоторых областях Франции детям рассказывают, что колокола улетели в Рим и на обратном пути принесут пасхальные яйца. "],["=",548],["+","Страстная пятница | Распятие | пятница перед Пасхой |\n| "],["=",73]]}],"hash":"0a176d1875b6"},
